  <ferc:ExplanatoryOfSecuritiesFinancingAndRefinancingTransactionTextBlock id="Tag432" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;In March 2025, Empire Pipeline, Inc. borrowed $25,000,000 and $50,000,000 from National Fuel Gas Company at interest rates of 5.708% (Note 25-1) and 6.119% (Note 25-2), respectively. The notes mature on March 15, 2030 and March 15, 2035, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:ExplanatoryOfSecuritiesFinancingAndRefinancingTransactionTextBlock>
