    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote11" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the year ended December 31, 2024, Empire recorded a non-cash impairment charge of $7.1 million in Account 426.5 to write down the carrying value of certain assets associated with the Northern Access project, which Empire is no longer pursuing. The impairment charge reduced the value of certain assets recorded in Account 107, Account 121, and Account 183.2 on the balance sheet.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
