      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value12" xlink:to="footnote12" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="12" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote13" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Cash Dividend on Common Stock.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value13" xlink:to="footnote13" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="13" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote14" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>In March 2025, Empire Pipeline, Inc. borrowed $25,000,000 and $50,000,000 from National Fuel Gas Company at interest rates of 5.708% and 6.119%, respectively. The notes mature on March 15, 2030 and March 15, 2035, respectively.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value14" xlink:to="footnote14" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="14" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote15" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>In March 2025, Empire Pipeline, Inc. also redeemed $75,000,000 of 5.779% notes that were originally scheduled to mature in January 2026 with the proceeds received from the aforementioned March 2025 long term advances from National Fuel Gas Company. The 5.779% notes were redeemed for $75,702,913, plus accrued interest. The call premium was recorded to Account 189, Unamortized Loss on Required Debt, in March 2025.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value15" xlink:to="footnote15" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="15" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote16" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the year ended December 31, 2024, Empire recorded a non-cash impairment charge of $7.1 million on Account 426.5 to write down the carrying value of certain assets associated with the Northern Access project, which Empire is no longer pursuing. The impairment charge reduced the value of certain assets recorded in Account 107, Account 121, and Account 183.2 on the balance sheet.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value16" xlink:to="footnote16" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="16" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote17" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI93-5-000 provided the authorization for this deferral, and was reaffirmed by Docket No. PL 19-2-000.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value17" xlink:to="footnote17" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="17" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote18" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>18 CFR Section 154.402 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value18" xlink:to="footnote18" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="18" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote19" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>CP06-5-000 and CP06-6-010 provided the authorization for this deferral. These are the orders approving Empire Pipeline, Inc.'s tariff.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value19" xlink:to="footnote19" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="19" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote20" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Stipulation and Agreement filed on July 22, 2016 under the Docket No. RP16-300-000 and subsequently approved by the Commission on December 13, 2016 provided authorization for this deferral. Activity for the year includes any over-collection or under-collection of retained quantities (net of any operational sales or operational purchases) as well as an adjustment to revalue the liability at the December 31, 2025 100% cashout index rate.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value20" xlink:to="footnote20" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="20" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote21" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>CP18-89-000 (Empire North filing which established te EPCR mechanism) provided the authorization for this deferral. RP20-1100 established initial EPCR rate which will change every April 1.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value21" xlink:to="footnote21" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="21" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote22" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire reclassified certain regulatory assets that had credit balances, which were reclassified as of both December 31, 2025 and December 31, 2024 from Other Regulatory Assets (Account 182.3) to Other Regulatory Liabilities (Account 254).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value22" xlink:to="footnote22" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="22" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote23" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire Pipeline, Inc. (which is incorporated in New York), has the authority to issue 10,000 shares of common stock. These shares are not traded on a public stock exchange.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value23" xlink:to="footnote23" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="23" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote24" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The following is a reconciliation of activity for the year:</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 38.5569%;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 28.1922%;">Balance at Beginning of Year</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 10.5623%; text-align: right;">$44,320,391</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 28.1922%;">Stock Based Compensation</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 10.5623%; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">446,762</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 28.1922%;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 10.5623%; text-align: right;">$44,767,153</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value24" xlink:to="footnote24" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="24" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote25" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>A102-1-000 and RM02-7-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value25" xlink:to="footnote25" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="25" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote26" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI93-5-000 provides regulatory authority for this deferral, and was reaffirmed by Docket No. PL 19-2-000.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value26" xlink:to="footnote26" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="26" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote27" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire reclassified certain regulatory assets that had credit balances, which were reclassified as of both December 31, 2025 and December 31, 2024 from Other Regulatory Assets (Account 182.3) to Other Regulatory Liabilities (Account 254).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value27" xlink:to="footnote27" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="27" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote28" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire leases storage capacity and associated transportation capacity from National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation to provide no-notice services (FSNN and FTNN).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value28" xlink:to="footnote28" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="28" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote30" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Net negative imbalances decreased inventory volumes by 50,970 Dth for the year (column c), and net positive imbalances increased inventory volumes by 28,889 Dth for the quarter (column d).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value30" xlink:to="footnote30" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="30" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote31" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Transportation volumes of 3,456,510 Dth for the year (column c) and 1,124,736 Dth for the quarter (column d) are not subject to ACA pursuant to Empire's FERC Gas Tariff.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value31" xlink:to="footnote31" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="31" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote32" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire has a contract with one of its customers to provide storage service. Empire does not currently own or operate storage facilities on its system, but Empire has a storage capacity lease with National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation in order to provide this storage service. These storage volumes for the year and the quarter are not subject to ACA pursuant to Empire's FERC Gas Tariff.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value32" xlink:to="footnote32" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="32" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote33" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>These volumes for the year and the quarter are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value33" xlink:to="footnote33" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="33" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote34" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Other Deliveries consists of:</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 535px; height: 80px;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 163.297px; height: 20px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 175.297px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">For the year (column c):</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 186.406px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">For the quarter (column d):</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 163.297px; height: 20px;">OGFTU</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 175.297px; height: 20px;">401,132</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 186.406px; height: 20px;">75,863</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 163.297px; height: 20px;">Line Pack Change</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 175.297px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">(16,065)</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 186.406px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">126,439</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 163.297px; height: 20px;">Total Other Deliveries</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 175.297px; height: 20px;">385,067</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 186.406px; height: 20px;">202,302</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
        <xhtml:p>These volumes shown above for the year and quarter are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value34" xlink:to="footnote34" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="34" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote35" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Amount represents Other Gas for Transporters Uses (OGFTU).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value35" xlink:to="footnote35" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="35" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote36" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Amount represents Other Gas for Transporters Uses (OGFTU).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value36" xlink:to="footnote36" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="36" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote37" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The source of the capital structure figures is Empire Pipeline Inc.'s parent company, National Fuel Gas.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value37" xlink:to="footnote37" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="37" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote38" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The source of the capital structure figures is Empire Pipeline Inc.'s parent company, National Fuel Gas.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value38" xlink:to="footnote38" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="38" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote39" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The source of the capital structure figures is Empire Pipeline Inc.'s parent company, National Fuel Gas.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value39" xlink:to="footnote39" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="39" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote41" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The difference between the interest total and Account 430 is due to interest on an escrow account.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value41" xlink:to="footnote41" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="41" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote43" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Estimated Allowed Rates of Return in FERC Case RP18-940, Effective January 1, 2019, Amended March 17, 2025.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value43" xlink:to="footnote43" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="43" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote44" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire leases storage capacity and associated transportation capacity from National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation to provide no-notice services (FSNN and FTNN). Empire Pipeline, Inc.'s current lease of 3,753,090 Dth of 68-day storage capacity provides a maximum withdrawal quantity of 55,000 Dth per day.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value44" xlink:to="footnote44" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="44" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote45" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>In March 2025, Empire Pipeline, Inc. redeemed $75,000,000 of 5.779% notes that were originally scheduled to mature in January 2026 with the proceeds received from Advances from Associated Companies in March 2025. The 5.779% notes were redeemed for $75,702,913 plus accrued interest.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value45" xlink:to="footnote45" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="45" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote46" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>In conjunction with the cancellation of the Northern Access Project, Empire returned a security deposit of $24,000,000 to Seneca Resources in March 2025.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value46" xlink:to="footnote46" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="46" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote47" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Information by rate schedule is not available. In accordance with Empire Pipeline, Inc.'s Tariff, Section 4.8, monthly imbalances for all agreements in effect for a single shipper are set off against each other to calculate the monthly shipper imbalance. Thus, imbalances are tracked by shipper (which may be operating under several rate schedules) and not by rate schedule. In addition, imbalances include those arising under Operation Balancing Agreements (OBAs) that have no related rate schedule.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value47" xlink:to="footnote47" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="47" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote48" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire Pipeline, Inc. does not own or operate storage facilities. Empire leases storage capacity and associated transportation capacity from National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation to provide no-notice services (FSNN and FTNN). Empire Pipeline, Inc.'s current lease of 3,753,090 Dth of 68-day storage capacity provides a maximum withdrawal quantity of 55,000 Dth per day.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value48" xlink:to="footnote48" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="48" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote49" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 295px; height: 60px;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 197.266px; height: 20px;">Qualified Pension Plan</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 90.7344px; text-align: right; height: 20px;">$ 0</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 197.266px; height: 20px;">Non-Qualified Pension Plans</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 90.7344px; text-align: right; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">76,088</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 197.266px; height: 20px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 90.7344px; text-align: right; height: 20px;">$76,088<xhtml:br /><xhtml:br /></xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value49" xlink:to="footnote49" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="49" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote50" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Amounts include gas received for compressor station fuel and gas received for Other Gas For Transporters Use (OGFTU) in accordance with Empire's FERC Gas Tariff, as follows:</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 530px; height: 80px;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 296.562px; height: 20px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 112.188px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">For the year (column c):</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 111.25px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">For the quarter (column d):</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 296.562px; height: 20px;">Gas Received for Compressor Fuel</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 112.188px; height: 20px;">1,645,973</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 111.25px; height: 20px;">466,503</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 296.562px; height: 20px;">Gas Received for OGFTU</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 112.188px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">320,101</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 111.25px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">159,151</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 296.562px; height: 20px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 112.188px; height: 20px;">1,966,074</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 111.25px; height: 20px;">625,654</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value50" xlink:to="footnote50" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="50" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote51" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Amounts include gas received for compressor station fuel and gas received for Other Gas Transporters Use (OGFTU) in accordance with Empire's FERC Gas Tariff. This is applicable for all months presented.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value51" xlink:to="footnote51" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="51" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote52" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November, and December, gas used for transmission compressor station fuel is allocated between the rate types (column b, c and d) based on the percentage of transmission shipper supplied gas per Line 4 Page 521.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value52" xlink:to="footnote52" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="52" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote53" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November, and December, gas used for other deliveries and for other operations is allocated between the rate types (columns b, c and d) based on the percentage of transmission shipper supplied gas per Line 4 on Page 521. These amounts represent OGFTU for the respective months.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value53" xlink:to="footnote53" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="53" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote54" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The 'Net Excess or (Deficiency)' represents gas expected to be passed back to / (or collected from) shippers through rate tracking mechanisms on an annual basis pursuant to Empire's FERC Gas Tariff. This footnote applies to lines 34, 43.1 and 55.1 (all columns).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value54" xlink:to="footnote54" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="54" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote55" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November, and December, the net excess gas or gas deficiency for each month is valued at 100% of the monthly cashout index rate for the respective month for columns f, g, h, and i.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value55" xlink:to="footnote55" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="55" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote56" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire Pipeline, Inc. does not have a mechanism in place to break out instances where backhaul has occurred. As such, all volumes are classified as forwardhaul.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value56" xlink:to="footnote56" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="56" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote57" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>No allocation of general plant or expense are included in these amounts.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value57" xlink:to="footnote57" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="57" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote58" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Excludes electric power costs and surcharge revenue as these items are part of Empire's electric power cost rate (EPCR) tracker mechanism.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value58" xlink:to="footnote58" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="58" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote59" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Excludes electric power costs and surcharge revenue as these items are part of Empire's EPCR tracker mechanism.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value59" xlink:to="footnote59" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="59" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote63" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:table style="height: 120px; border-collapse: collapse; width: 464px; margin-left: 0.1px;" border="0" width="445" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
