    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value64" xlink:to="footnote64" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="64" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote65" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 32.9815%; height: 80px;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 85.9688px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">Account Number</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 92.0625px; height: 20px;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">(Debits) / Credits</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 85.9688px; height: 20px;">182</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 92.0625px; height: 20px; text-align: left;">$51,533</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 85.9688px;">254</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td>
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">1,482,080</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 85.9688px; height: 20px;">Total</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 92.0625px; height: 20px; text-align: left;">$1,533,613<xhtml:br /><xhtml:br /></xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value65" xlink:to="footnote65" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="65" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote66" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire Pipeline, Inc. uses the fixed asset model provisions of FERC Order 581 in accounting for its stored gas inventory, recorded in Account 117.4.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value66" xlink:to="footnote66" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="66" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote67" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>"Gas Stored Underground - Current" represents gas reclassified from Account 117.3 since such amounts are expected to be passed back to/(or collected from) customers through rate tracking mechanisms in the next year.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value67" xlink:to="footnote67" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="67" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote68" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Farmington compressor station's two compressor units are both electric driven.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value68" xlink:to="footnote68" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="68" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote69" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Labor is borrowed from Supply Corporation at cost, including benefits, and is used to perform field work in the areas of transmission and some administrative and general work. The cost of the borrowed labor is charged to a variety of accounts including: 107, 108, 146, 183, 186, 242, 850, 851, 853, 856, 857, 859, 861, 862, 863, 864, 865, 867, 920, 925 and 926.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value69" xlink:to="footnote69" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="69" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote70" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Other category is a summation of charges from Supply Corporation that includes the use of vehicle and tools by the employee whose labor was borrowed from Supply Corporation, rental charges, inventory transferred from Supply Corporation, the allocation for Gas Measurement expense, the allocation for Transportation Services, the allocation of miscellaneous Officer expenses and other small miscellaneous expenses. Additionally, costs are charged to: 107, 108, 154, 183, 186, 850, 851, 853, 856, 857, 859, 861, 862, 863, 864, 865, 867, 920, 921, 925 and 931.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value70" xlink:to="footnote70" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="70" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote71" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Labor is borrowed from NYD Corporation at cost, including benefits, and is used to perform field work in the areas of transmission and some administrative and general work. The cost of the borrowed labor is charged to a variety of accounts including: 107, 108, 183, 242, 850, 853, 856, 857, 859, 861, 863, 864, 865, 867, 920, 925, 926 and 932.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value71" xlink:to="footnote71" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="71" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote72" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Common Expense allocations are the administrative and general costs of certain "common" departments, whose costs are allocated to the subsidiaries that benefit from the work of those departments. The allocation is based on a three factor formula which includes Net Plant, MCF Throughput, and Operating and Maintenance expense. The costs are charged to the following accounts: 163, 920, 921, 923, 925, 926, 930 and 931.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value72" xlink:to="footnote72" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="72" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote73" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Other category is a summation of charges from NYD that includes Executive Labor &amp; Fringes, Inventory, Rental expense and vehicle and tools used by the employees whose labor was borrowed from NYD. The Other category also includes the following allocations: Officer expense, Postage, Information Services allocations related to shared capital costs, Mail, Copy &amp; Print (MCP) room costs, document destruction costs, cybersecurity costs, command center costs, meter shop costs and software maintenance costs. Charges are to the following accounts: 107, 108, 186, 850, 853, 856, 857, 859, 861, 862, 863, 864, 865, 867, 920, 921, 923, 925, 930, 931 and 932.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value73" xlink:to="footnote73" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="73" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote74" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Other category is a summation of charges from associated companies that includes the use of vehicles and tools by the employees whose labor was borrowed from PAD along with those labor charges, Officer allocations, executive labor costs, rent expense, Information Services allocations and miscellaneous adjustments from associated companies. Charges are to the following accounts: 107, 183, 186, 430, 863, 920, 921, 925 and 931.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value74" xlink:to="footnote74" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="74" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote75" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>This amount includes amounts collected for state tax surcharges (authorized by Docket No. RP09-443-000).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value75" xlink:to="footnote75" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="75" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote77" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Other category is a summation of charges loaned to various subsidiaries. They include rental income, loaned labor (including benefits), Officer allocations, inventory, common expense allocations and miscellaneous allocations (Transportation Services and IT Cybersecurity). Charges are to the following accounts: 154, 163, 234, 493, 850, 920, 921, 926, 930 and 931. See note on line 8 (described in footnote (d) above) for a description of Common Expense.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value77" xlink:to="footnote77" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="77" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote78" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The consecutive three-day peak delivery dates were 2026-02-07 through 2026-02-09 (please note that the form for page 518, line 20 only allows a singular date to be entered instead of a three-day range of dates).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value78" xlink:to="footnote78" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="78" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote79" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Due to FERC Form 2 programming constraints, line 21 reflects Intangible balances and not Production-Manufactured Gas as labeled.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value79" xlink:to="footnote79" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="79" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote80" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>This balance is primarily comprised of transmission lines and compressor station equipment. This includes Transmission Other of $650,344 and Transmission Turbine Engines of $19,062.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value80" xlink:to="footnote80" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="80" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote81" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">Amount</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">Depreciation Rate</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%;">Transmission Other</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;">$650,344</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;">1.85%</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%;">Transmission Turbine Engines</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;">$19,062</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;">8.50%</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value81" xlink:to="footnote81" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="81" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrli:xbrl>
